;set target temp to 210C, wait until reached

M104 S200
;set target temp to 200C, do not wait run next line immediately

G1 E30 F300
;push 30mm of filament at a speed of 300mm/minute (5mm/second for 6 seconds)

M109 S200
;set target temp to 200C, wait until reached

G4 S5
;wait 5 seconds

